    "description": "Premature ejaculation is not judged by one encounter or a stopwatch alone.",
    "content": "## Understanding the topic\n\nPremature ejaculation is not judged by one encounter or a stopwatch alone. Perceived control, distress and context matter. Stress, sexual experiences and some health conditions can contribute. [1](https://www.nhs.uk/conditions/ejaculation-problems/) [2](https://www.royalberkshire.nhs.uk/media/avwg3hls/pelvic-floor-strengthening-and-relaxation-exercises-for-men_jun24.pdf) [3](https://www.devonsexualhealth.nhs.uk/your-sexual-health/relationships-and-intimacy/)\n\n## What you can do\n\nDiscuss pacing, pausing and comfortable activities with your partner. Recurrent, distressing difficulties can be addressed with a clinician or sex therapist who can explain treatment options.\n\n## What the evidence cannot tell you\n\nThere is insufficient basis to promise that one Kegel contraction will lock the ejaculation reflex. Avoid forced tightening, breath-holding or straining as a required technique.\n\n## When to seek advice\n\nNew sudden difficulties, pain or urinary symptoms warrant assessment before relying on technique practice.\n\n## Sources and what they support\n\n1. [NHS — Ejaculation problems](https://www.nhs.uk/conditions/ejaculation-problems/) — Public health guidance. Supports: Ejaculatory difficulties and treatment options.\n\n2. [Royal Berkshire NHS (2024) — Pelvic floor strengthening and relaxation exercises for men](https://www.royalberkshire.nhs.uk/media/avwg3hls/pelvic-floor-strengthening-and-relaxation-exercises-for-men_jun24.pdf) — Physiotherapy patient guidance. Supports: Strengthening and relaxation; not a prescription to tighten for everyone.\n\n3. [Devon Sexual Health (NHS) — Relationships and intimacy](https://www.devonsexualhealth.nhs.uk/your-sexual-health/relationships-and-intimacy/) — Sexual health service guidance. Supports: Consent, intimacy and masturbation.\n\n> Content and sources updated: 2026-10-26. Educational content; clinical sign-off has not been recorded.\n",
